# 其他锁与并发工具
## 1. ReadWriteLock（读写锁）
`ReentrantReadWriteLock` 将锁分为读锁和写锁，读锁可以被多个线程同时持有，写锁是独占的。适用于"读多写少"的场景。
### 1.1 基本用法
```java
import java.util.concurrent.locks.ReentrantReadWriteLock;
import java.util.concurrent.locks.ReadWriteLock;
public class ReadWriteLockDemo {
    private final ReadWriteLock rwLock = new ReentrantReadWriteLock();
    private final ReentrantReadWriteLock.ReadLock readLock = rwLock.readLock();
    private final ReentrantReadWriteLock.WriteLock writeLock = rwLock.writeLock();
    private final Map<String, String> cache = new HashMap<>();
    // 读操作：多个线程可以同时读
    public String get(String key) {
        readLock.lock();
        try {
            return cache.get(key);
        } finally {
            readLock.unlock();
        }
}
// 写操作：独占，写的时候不能读也不能写
public void put(String key, String value) {
    writeLock.lock();
    try {
        cache.put(key, value);
    } finally {
        writeLock.unlock();
    }
}
}
```
### 1.2 锁降级（写锁降级为读锁）
```java
/**
* 锁降级：持有写锁的线程可以在不释放写锁的情况下获取读锁，然后释放写锁
* 这样就从写锁降级为读锁
*/
public class LockDowngradeDemo {
    private final ReentrantReadWriteLock rwLock = new ReentrantReadWriteLock();
    private final ReentrantReadWriteLock.ReadLock readLock = rwLock.readLock();
    private final ReentrantReadWriteLock.WriteLock writeLock = rwLock.writeLock();
    private String data;
    public void processData() {
        writeLock.lock(); // 获取写锁
        try {
            data = "updated";
            readLock.lock(); // 在持有写锁时获取读锁（锁降级的关键步骤）
        } finally {
            writeLock.unlock(); // 释放写锁，此时还持有读锁
        }
    try {
        // 使用读锁读取数据
        System.out.println("Data: " + data);
    } finally {
        readLock.unlock(); // 释放读锁
    }
}
}
```
### 1.3 注意事项
```java
/**
* 读锁不支持升级为写锁！
* 下面的代码会导致死锁：
*/
public class LockUpgradeDemo {
    private final ReentrantReadWriteLock rwLock = new ReentrantReadWriteLock();
    public void wrongUpgrade() {
        rwLock.readLock().lock();
        try {
            // 尝试获取写锁 → 死锁！
            // 因为读锁被当前线程持有，写锁需要等所有读锁释放
            rwLock.writeLock().lock(); // 永远获取不到！
        } finally {
            rwLock.readLock().unlock();
        }
}
}
```
### 要点
- 读锁共享：多个线程可以同时持有读锁
- 写锁独占：写锁和读锁、写锁和写锁都互斥
- 支持锁降级（写→读），不支持锁升级（读→写，会死锁）
- 适用于读多写少的场景（如缓存）
## 2. StampedLock
Java 8 引入的高性能读写锁，支持三种模式：写锁、悲观读锁、乐观读。
### 2.1 三种模式
```java
import java.util.concurrent.locks.StampedLock;
public class StampedLockDemo {
    private final StampedLock sl = new StampedLock();
    private double x, y;
    // 写锁
    public void move(double deltaX, double deltaY) {
        long stamp = sl.writeLock(); // 获取写锁，返回一个 stamp
        try {
            x += deltaX;
            y += deltaY;
        } finally {
            sl.unlockWrite(stamp); // 用 stamp 释放写锁
        }
}
// 悲观读锁（与 ReentrantReadWriteLock 类似）
public double distancePessimistic() {
    long stamp = sl.readLock(); // 获取悲观读锁
    try {
        return Math.sqrt(x * x + y * y);
    } finally {
        sl.unlockRead(stamp);
    }
}
// 乐观读（不加锁，通过 validate 校验数据一致性）
public double distanceOptimistic() {
    long stamp = sl.tryOptimisticRead(); // 乐观读，不加锁
    double curX = x, curY = y;
    if (!sl.validate(stamp)) {
        // 数据被修改，升级为悲观读锁
        stamp = sl.readLock();
        try {
            curX = x;
            curY = y;
        } finally {
            sl.unlockRead(stamp);
        }
}
return Math.sqrt(curX * curX + curY * curY);
}
}
```
### 要点
- StampedLock 不是可重入锁！在同一线程中重复获取会死锁
- 乐观读不加锁，性能最高，适合读多写少且冲突很少的场景
- StampedLock 不支持 Condition
- 乐观读后需要 validate 校验，失败则升级为悲观读锁
## 3. CountDownLatch（倒计时门闩）
CountDownLatch 允许一个或多个线程等待其他线程完成操作后再继续执行。
### 3.1 典型用法：等待N个线程完成
```java
import java.util.concurrent.CountDownLatch;
public class CountDownLatchDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws InterruptedException {
        final int threadCount = 5;
        CountDownLatch latch = new CountDownLatch(threadCount);
        for (int i = 0; i < threadCount; i++) {
            final int taskId = i;
            new Thread(() -> {
                try {
                    System.out.println("任务 " + taskId + " 开始执行");
                    Thread.sleep((long) (Math.random() * 2000));
                    System.out.println("任务 " + taskId + " 执行完毕");
                } catch (InterruptedException e) {
                    e.printStackTrace();
                } finally {
                    latch.countDown(); // 计数减 1
                }
        }).start();
}
latch.await(); // 等待计数减到 0
System.out.println("所有任务执行完毕，主线程继续");
}
}
```
### 3.2 典型用法：N个线程同时开始
```java
/**
* 模拟并发测试：让 N 个线程同时开始执行
*/
public class ConcurrentStartDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws InterruptedException {
        final int threadCount = 10;
        CountDownLatch startLatch = new CountDownLatch(1); // 主线程发令
        CountDownLatch endLatch = new CountDownLatch(threadCount); // 等待所有线程完成
        for (int i = 0; i < threadCount; i++) {
            final int id = i;
            new Thread(() -> {
                try {
                    startLatch.await(); // 所有线程在此等待
                    System.out.println("线程 " + id + " 开始执行，时间: " + System.currentTimeMillis());
                    Thread.sleep(1000);
                } catch (InterruptedException e) {
                    e.printStackTrace();
                } finally {
                    endLatch.countDown();
                }
        }).start();
}
Thread.sleep(100);
System.out.println("发令枪响！");
startLatch.countDown(); // 所有线程同时开始
endLatch.await();
System.out.println("所有线程执行完毕");
}
}
```
### 要点
- CountDownLatch 是**一次性**的，计数归零后不能重置
- countDown() 可以在任何线程调用，不限于创建它的线程
- await() 会阻塞直到计数归零
- 典型场景：等待多个服务启动完成、并发测试
## 4. CyclicBarrier（循环栅栏）
CyclicBarrier 让一组线程互相等待，直到所有线程都到达栅栏点后再一起继续执行。
### 4.1 基本用法
```java
import java.util.concurrent.CyclicBarrier;
public class CyclicBarrierDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        final int parties = 3;
        // 所有线程到达栅栏后执行 barrierAction
        CyclicBarrier barrier = new CyclicBarrier(parties, () -> {
            System.out.println("所有线程已到达栅栏，一起出发！");
        });
    for (int i = 0; i < parties; i++) {
        final int id = i;
        new Thread(() -> {
            try {
                System.out.println("线程 " + id + " 正在准备...");
                Thread.sleep((long) (Math.random() * 2000));
                System.out.println("线程 " + id + " 到达栅栏");
                barrier.await(); // 等待其他线程
                System.out.println("线程 " + id + " 通过栅栏，继续执行");
            } catch (Exception e) {
                e.printStackTrace();
            }
    }).start();
}
}
}
```
### 4.2 可重复使用
```java
/**
* CyclicBarrier 可以重复使用（CountDownLatch 不行）
* 模拟多轮比赛
*/
public class CyclicBarrierReusableDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        final int parties = 3;
        CyclicBarrier barrier = new CyclicBarrier(parties);
        for (int i = 0; i < parties; i++) {
            final int id = i;
            new Thread(() -> {
                for (int round = 1; round <= 3; round++) {
                    try {
                        System.out.println("线程 " + id + " 完成第 " + round + " 轮");
                        barrier.await(); // 每轮都等待其他线程
                    } catch (Exception e) {
                        e.printStackTrace();
                    }
            }
    }).start();
}
}
}
```
